{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46849","headline":"塘上闲作 · 齐己","name":"塘上闲作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲行闲坐藉莎烟，此兴堪思二古贤。\n陶靖节居彭泽畔，贺知章在镜池边。\n鸳鸯着对能飞绣，菡萏成羣不语仙。\n形影腾腾夕阳里，数峰危翠滴渔船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46849.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46849","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}